# Bounty postings + submissions written by a running instance. Runtime data, not repo seed data -- see ADR 0009.
data/bounties/
# A local Redis server's own snapshot, written if one is ever started with this folder as its cwd -- never repo data.
dump.rdb
# @osstrace/server's own SQLite store (accounts, traces, labels, transfers cache, ...). Runtime data, not repo seed data -- see ADR 0022.
